00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,120
Yeah, the entire summer vacation.

252
00:11:34,210 --> 00:11:42,350
I don't remember exactly what I did, but my dad was pretty upset with me and yeah, he was really strict, so I got grounded quite a bit.

253
00:11:42,730 --> 00:11:44,730
I tend to think that girls get in trouble less.

254
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:46,080
I think so.

255
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:46,650
I don't know if it's because they're good.

256
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:50,900
I think probably it's because they're better at hiding things from their parents.

257
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:52,600
Maybe.

258
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:59,280
Because whenever I would come home, my mother would always wake up, but she doesn't really understand what time it is, and so I'd say, oh, mom, it's 11 o'clock.

259
00:11:59,280 --> 00:11:59,540
Good night.

260
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:03,400
And it'd be like 4 o'clock in the morning, and she had no idea.

261
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:07,550
So who was the person or the parent that put their foot down?

262
00:12:07,690 --> 00:12:08,570
Was it your mom or your dad?

263
00:12:08,770 --> 00:12:10,050
My dad was the serious one.

264
00:12:10,190 --> 00:12:10,530
Oh, really?

265
00:12:11,250 --> 00:12:21,290
Yeah, it's interesting because sometimes it's the dad that's very strict, and the mom kind of helps you out and tries to kind of not get you grounded or something, but sometimes it's the other way around.

266
00:12:21,470 --> 00:12:24,430
The mom is really strict and firm, and the dad's like, come on, don't ground him.

267
00:12:24,850 --> 00:12:25,950
They're just having fun.

268
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:40,760
Well, I think in some families, the children understand who is strict and who is maybe not so strict, and so they say, oh, well, mom said that it's okay, so I think maybe you should let me go out, and the dad will be very angry because the mother said that it's okay.

269
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:41,760
That's right.

